{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a glimpse of the nightmare in <strong>Backrooms MultiVerses DEMO</strong> \u2014 a sample of reality gone wrong. Explore several unique and highly detailed levels, each hiding new dangers, puzzles, and strange anomalies waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid deadly traps, solve eerie puzzles, and look for any possible exit. But be warned: one wrong turn might take you somewhere you\u2019re not supposed to be... and there\u2019s no way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not a place of safety. There\u2019s no pause. No help. Just you, the endless hum, and something watching in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you can handle it? Or will you get lost between layers?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829980?t=1751912392","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829980?t=1751912392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829980/b47843b926ccd9f470b3bde6e3d32bca21bfea45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751912392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829980/b47843b926ccd9f470b3bde6e3d32bca21bfea45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751912392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a glimpse of the nightmare in <strong>Backrooms MultiVerses DEMO</strong> \u2014 a sample of reality gone wrong. Explore several unique and highly detailed levels, each hiding new dangers, puzzles, and strange anomalies waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid deadly traps, solve eerie puzzles, and look for any possible exit. But be warned: one wrong turn might take you somewhere you\u2